OL,3,GNEWSAEscaped pigs saved from being shot
OL,4,Athanks to locals
OL,5,
OL,6,FPigs who escaped onto a busy dual
OL,7,Fcarriageway have been saved from
OL,8,Fslaughter after the community rallied
OL,9,Ftogether.
OL,11,FThe animals caused mayhem on the A127
OL,12,Fat Dunton, near Basildon, when they
OL,13,Fdarted between cars last week, leading
OL,14,Fto the road's closure.
OL,16,FEssex police said five pigs had to be
OL,17,Fshot at the scene for safety reasons,
OL,18,Fbut one ended up at Tower Hill Stables,
OL,19,Fin Asheldham, after seeking refuge in a
OL,20,Fresident's garden.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
