OL,3,GNEWSAEscaped pigs saved from being shot
OL,4,Athanks to locals
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight of the pigs were due to be
OL,7,Fslaughtered on Tuesday, but an online
OL,8,Ffundraiser has saved their bacon after
OL,9,Falmost #6,000 was raised towards their
OL,10,Fupkeep.
